  <div id="sutta">
  
    <h4 id="thig5.6" class="h1">Thig 5:6  Mittakālī</h4>
          <div class="verse">
            <p>Going forth through conviction</p>
            <p>from home into homelessness,</p>
            <p>I wandered this place &amp; that,</p>
            <p>greedy for tribute &amp; gains.</p>
            <p>Missing out on the foremost goal,</p>
            <p>I pursued a lowly one.</p>
            <p>Under the sway of defilements,</p>
            <p>I didn’t awaken<span class="fn"><a href="#thig5.6note01">1</a></span><!--end fn cite--> to the goal</p>
            <p>of the contemplative life.</p>
            <div class="verse-add">
              <p>Then, sitting in my dwelling,</p>
              <p>I suddenly came to my senses:</p>
            </div><!--end verse-add-->
            <div class="verse-add">
              <p class="v2"><em>I’m following a miserable path.</em></p>
              <p class="v2"><em>I’m under the sway of</em></p>
              <p class="v4"><em>craving.</em></p>
              <p class="v2"><em>Next to nothing, my life,</em></p>
              <p class="v6"><em>crushed</em></p>
              <p class="v2"><em>by aging &amp; illness.</em></p>
              <p class="v2"><em>Before the body breaks apart,</em></p>
              <p class="v2"><em>I have no time</em></p>
              <p class="v4"><em>for heedlessness.</em></p>
            </div><!--end verse-add-->
            <div class="verse-add">
              <p>After watching, as it actually was,</p>
              <p>the arising-disbanding of aggregates,</p>
              <p>I stood up with mind released,</p>
              <p>the Awakened One’s bidding</p>
              <p>done.</p>
            </div><!--end verse-add-->
          </div><!--end verse-->
          <div class="note">
            <p class="notetitle">Note</p><!--end notetitle-->
            <p id="thig5.6note01">1. Reading <em>na bujjhi’ham</em> with the Burmese and Sinhalese editions.</p>
          </div><!--end notes-->
          <p class="seealso">See also: <a href="../../MN/MN29.html">MN 29–30</a>; <a href="../../SN/SN17_3.html">SN 17:3</a>; <a href="../../SN/SN17_5.html">SN 17:5</a>; <a href="../../SN/SN17_8.html">SN 17:8</a></p><!--end seealso-->
      </div><!--end:sutta-->
